# The Theorist, Jace Beleren in a three-player game. "At the beginning of each opponent's draw step, you draw a card" fires
# in Bot2's draw step and again in Bot3's: Bot1 draws on both turns. Bot1 casts Jace on turn 1 (Black Lotus and an
# Island); Bot2 has an Ornithopter and a Mox Jet, Bot3 a Sol Ring. On turn 4 the -2 "for each opponent, return up to one target
# artifact or creature that player controls": Bot1 picks Bot2's Ornithopter, and then Bot2's Mox Jet is not on offer for the
# next target (one per opponent) - Bot3's Sol Ring is; no third target is asked for, as both opponents have one. Ornithopter
# and Sol Ring go to their owners' hands, the Mox Jet stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
The Theorist, Jace Beleren
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Island x5
Island x12

[Bot3 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Island x5
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Theorist, Jace Beleren.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot3.Hand.Island.Play
Bot3.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.The Theorist, Jace Beleren.Activate(Ability: For each opponent)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Bot3.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
! Bot1.Target
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot3.Battlefield = Island
Bot3.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Sol Ring
Bot1.Battlefield.The Theorist, Jace Beleren.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Stack.Count = 0
